": 254448, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 127, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/83/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/83/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 44.825, "size_bytes": 269856, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 127, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/83/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/83/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 37.925, "size_bytes": 228528, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 127, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/83/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/83/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 41.55, "size_bytes": 250272, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 127, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/83/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@91b304e/content/data/versions/822.json", "paragraphs": ["The phones come in black, white and two new colours. They are strong against dust and water. A small light on the back can change colour, which is fun for games.", "Both phones have a 185Hz screen. This makes games look smooth. The screen is also easy on the eyes, with low blue light.", "The Ace 7 Pro uses a strong Snapdragon 8 chip. The Ace 7 uses a similar chip. Both have a 9000mAh battery and 100W fast charging.", "The main camera is 200 megapixels. The Pro model also has a zoom lens. Prices start at 3649 yuan for the Pro and 3249 yuan for the Ace 7."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这两款手机有黑色、白色和两种新配色。它们防尘防水。背面有一盏小灯，可以变色，玩游戏时很有意思。", "两款手机都配 185Hz 屏幕，玩游戏画面很流畅。屏幕也护眼，蓝光低。", "Ace 7 Pro 用强劲的骁龙 8 芯片，Ace 7 用相似的芯片。两款都有 9000mAh 电池和 100W 快充。", "主摄为 2 亿像素。Pro 版还有长焦镜头。Pro 版起售价 3649 元，Ace 7 起售价 3249 元。"], "body": "The phones come in black, white and two new colours. They are strong against dust and water. A small light on the back can change colour, which is fun for games.\n\nBoth phones have a 185Hz screen. This makes games look smooth. The screen is also easy on the eyes, with low blue light.\n\nThe Ace 7 Pro uses a strong Snapdragon 8 chip. The Ace 7 uses a similar chip. Both have a 9000mAh battery and 100W fast charging.\n\nThe main camera is 200 megapixels. The Pro model also has a zoom lens. Prices start at 3649 yuan for the Pro and 3249 yuan for the Ace 7.", "body_zh": "这两款手机有黑色、白色和两种新配色。它们防尘防水。背面有一盏小灯，可以变色，玩游戏时很有意思。\n\n两款手机都配 185Hz 屏幕，玩游戏画面很流畅。屏幕也护眼，蓝光低。\n\nAce 7 Pro 用强劲的骁龙 8 芯片，Ace 7 用相似的芯片。两款都有 9000mAh 电池和 100W 快充。\n\n主摄为 2 亿像素。Pro 版还有长焦镜头。Pro 版起售价 3649 元，Ace 7 起售价 3249 元。", "text": "The phones come in black, white and two new colours. They are strong against dust and water. A small light on the back can change colour, which is fun for games. Both phones have a 185Hz screen. This makes games look smooth. The screen is also easy on the eyes, with low blue light. The Ace 7 Pro uses a strong Snapdragon 8 chip. The Ace 7 uses a similar chip. Both have a 9000mAh battery and 100W fast charging. The main camera is 200 megapixels. The Pro model also has a zoom lens. Prices start at 3649 yuan for the Pro and 3249 yuan for the Ace 7.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布", "note": "常指新品上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "battery", "pos": "noun", "zh": "电池", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "screen", "pos": "noun", "zh": "屏幕", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "chip", "pos": "noun", "zh": "芯片", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "camera", "pos": "noun", "zh": "摄像头", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "zoom", "pos": "noun", "zh": "变焦", "note": "zoom lens 指长焦镜头", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "charging", "pos": "noun", "zh": "充电